00:31:40.293 --> 00:31:41.572
Tengok awak.

00:31:42.092 --> 00:31:43.493
Walaupun terluka, awak tetap berseri.

00:31:47.533 --> 00:31:48.493
Pada masa lalu,

00:31:48.773 --> 00:31:50.092
awak sentiasa menjaga saya.

00:31:51.372 --> 00:31:52.852
Sekarang anda cedera,

00:31:53.053 --> 00:31:54.572
