Semasa kami mengembara ke utara,

00:36:02.212 --> 00:36:03.493
kami akan lalu.

00:36:03.652 --> 00:36:05.184
Pencarian ubat anda boleh diteruskan

00:36:05.184 --> 00:36:06.533
semasa menyelesaikan masalah saya.

00:36:06.533 --> 00:36:07.692
Manfaat dua kali ganda.

00:36:09.933 --> 00:36:11.212
Lin Hu, adakah anda gembira

00:36:11.212 --> 00:36:12.172
